  },
  "question": {
    "text": "A car is moving with speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>150</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and after applying the brake it will move <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> before it stops. If the same car is moving with a speed of one third the reported speed then it will stop after travelling _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> distance."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>In both cases, the final velocity is zero. Using equation of motion for constant acceleration</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mn>27</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>...</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mn>27</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
